@startuml Manager Create Promotion Sequence
title Sequence Diagram: Tạo khuyến mãi mới (Manager)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-promotions.html" as UI
control "PromotionController" as Ctrl
entity "PromotionService" as Svc
database "MySQL" as DB

Manager -> UI: Nhập Voucher Code, Giảm giá, Thời hạn áp dụng
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/promotions (PromotionRequest)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: createPromotion(request)
activate Svc

Svc -> Svc: Map DTO to Entity(Promotion)
Svc -> DB: save(promotion)
activate DB
DB --> Svc: promotionEntity
deactivate DB

Svc --> Ctrl: promotionResponseDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate Ctrl

UI -> Manager: Thông báo tạo thành công
@enduml
